## Running Tests

{% if stack in ["python-fastapi", "python-fastapi-nextjs", "fullstack-desktop", "python-cli"] %}
### Backend

```bash
{% if stack == "python-cli" %}
uv run pytest tests/ -v
uv run pytest tests/ -m unit -v          # unit tests only
{% else %}
# Requires running Postgres (docker compose up -d postgres)
cd backend
uv run pytest tests/ -v                  # all tests
uv run pytest tests/ -m unit -v         # unit tests only (no DB)
uv run pytest tests/ -m integration -v  # integration tests (needs DB)
uv run pytest tests/test_auth.py -v     # single file
```
{% endif %}

**Test layout:**
```
tests/
  unit/           — pure logic, no I/O, no DB (fast)
  integration/    — real DB + Redis, use fixtures for setup/teardown
  conftest.py     — shared fixtures (async session, test client, factories)
```
{% endif %}

{% if stack in ["nextjs-fullstack", "python-fastapi-nextjs", "fullstack-desktop"] %}
### Frontend

```bash
cd frontend
npm test                   # Jest + React Testing Library (unit)
npm run test:watch         # watch mode
npm run e2e                # Playwright end-to-end
```
{% endif %}

