## Deployment

{% if stack in ["python-fastapi", "python-fastapi-nextjs", "fullstack-desktop"] %}
### Environment setup

```bash
# Production — set these in your deployment platform, never in code:
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://...
REDIS_URL=redis://...
JWT_SECRET=<openssl rand -hex 32>
ENVIRONMENT=production
```

### Database migrations (run before each deploy)

```bash
uv run alembic upgrade head
```
{% endif %}

{% if stack == "fullstack-desktop" %}
### Desktop build (Tauri)

```bash
# Build frontend static export
cd frontend && npm run build

# Bundle desktop app (produces platform-specific installer)
cd src-tauri && cargo tauri build
# Output: src-tauri/target/release/bundle/
```
{% endif %}

{% if stack in ["nextjs-fullstack", "python-fastapi-nextjs"] %}
### Frontend deploy

```bash
cd frontend
npm run build          # static export or server build
# Deploy dist/out/ to your hosting platform
```
{% endif %}

{% if stack == "python-cli" %}
### Package / distribute

```bash
uv build               # produces dist/*.whl + dist/*.tar.gz
pipx install dist/*.whl  # local install for testing
```
{% endif %}
